# A C translation unit exposes its function: fadd shows up as a func row.
# kind is the symbol-kind column and func the row kind for functions.
# REQUIRES: x86_64, gcc
# RUN: gcc -O2 -fPIE -pie -o %t %S/info_c_fadd.c && perf info %t -e kind,name 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s
# CHECK-NOT: Traceback
# CHECK: kind name
# CHECK: func fadd
# CHECK-NOT: Traceback
